
>> countries := ସାରଣୀ ନୂତନ
	~ ['Switzerland']
	~ ['Italy']
	~ ['Germany'].

>> foods := ସାରଣୀ ନୂତନ
	~ ['Rösti']
	~ ['Spaghetti']
	~ ['Sauerkraut'].


>> counter := 0.
foods ଅନୁସାରେ: countries, ପ୍ରତ୍ୟେକ: { :key :value
	counter ମିଶାଅ: 1.
}.

ଆଉଟପୁଟ୍ ଲେଖ: (['we serve counter dishes'] counter: counter), ନୂଆ-ଧାଡ଼ି.

>> counter := 42.
['TrytosortthiswithoutsegfaultingButActualNumberDe✎dsOnOS'] ଅକ୍ଷରଗୁଡ଼ିକ ସଜାଅ: { :v
	counter ମିଶାଅ: 0.
}.

ଆଉଟପୁଟ୍ ଲେଖ: (['we sort counter dishes'] counter: counter), ନୂଆ-ଧାଡ଼ି.


>> counter := 0.
{
	{
		counter ମିଶାଅ: 1.
	} × (3 + 1 + 1 × 0.5).
} × 100.


ଆଉଟପୁଟ୍ ଲେଖ: (['we calculate counter numbers.'] counter: counter), ନୂଆ-ଧାଡ଼ି.

